# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values.
# Never commit the real .env file - it is already listed in .gitignore.

# Required - used by the AI recommendation page.
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Required - the home page, More Info panel, and AI page all need this
# (the assignment itself requires CoinGecko for these). The Demo key is
# genuinely free (no credit card - don't confuse it with CoinGecko's
# separate paid consumer "Premium" subscription for the coingecko.com
# app, which is a different product). The fully keyless public endpoint
# technically works too, but it's heavily rate-limited and shared across
# everyone hitting it from the same network, so the coin list can come
# back empty under normal use without a key.
# Get a free Demo key (no credit card) at:
#   https://www.coingecko.com/en/api/pricing -> "Create Free Account"
#   -> Developer Dashboard -> API Keys -> + Add New Key
VITE_COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# Optional - CryptoCompare (now "CoinDesk Data") gives true 1-second live
# price updates when configured. It requires applying for a free "Personal"
# account (capped on total lifetime calls, not a renewing monthly quota -
# see README), which is some friction to set up. If you don't have a key,
# just leave this empty: the app automatically uses Kraken instead (no
# signup, no key, no cap needed, still 1-second updates for the ~73% of
# coins Kraken lists), with CoinPaprika as a further backup for the rest.
VITE_CRYPTOCOMPARE_API_KEY=
